The code in this folder is vendored from the unofficial Hugging Face packaging of BTC,
https://huggingface.co/puar-playground/btc-chord, revision d436f2f664f5107cd987774279b8ce171846e376
(files btc_src/btc_model.py, btc_src/transformer_modules.py, btc_src/features.py and the inference
loop of modeling_btc.py), which its model card publishes under the MIT licence. That packaging
contains the network and feature code of the original project:

    BTC-ISMIR19 — A Bi-Directional Transformer for Musical Chord Recognition
    https://github.com/jayg996/BTC-ISMIR19

Changes for Квартирник: the `transformers` / `huggingface_hub` loader is dropped (weights are loaded
by path from service/.models), two files are merged into model.py, the inference runs the
108-frame chunks in batches, and the CQT input may come at any sample rate (it is resampled to
22 050 Hz as `librosa.load` would). The network itself is unchanged, so the original weights load.

The licence of the original project follows.

